---
title: "cancel (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_guard: onlyProject AND whenNotPaused AND whenSaleNotCanceled AND whenTokensNotSupplied
    q_guard --> q_cache: guards pass
    q_cache --> q_mark: capitalToReturn = totalCapitalWithdrawn
    q_mark --> q_emit: isCanceled = true
    q_emit --> q_check_return: emit SaleCanceled()
    q_check_return --> q_return_capital: capitalToReturn > 0
    q_return_capital --> q_reset: totalCapitalWithdrawn = 0
    q_reset --> [*]: safeTransferFrom(bidToken, msg.sender, address(this), capitalToReturn)
    q_check_return --> [*]: capitalToReturn == 0 (no capital to return)

    note right of q_return_capital
        INV-001: project must return previously withdrawn capital on cancellation
        INV-002: totalCapitalWithdrawn reset to 0 after capital returned
        INV-003: cancel only possible before tokens are supplied
        INV-004: safeTransferFrom pulls capital back from project (requires prior approval)
    end note
